graph LR
    ENTRY[CLI / TUI / Scheduler] --> ORCH[Patrol Orchestrator]
    ORCH --> RUN[(Run & Action State)]
    ORCH --> OBS[Observer]
    ORCH --> DECIDE[Analyzer + Investigator]
    ORCH --> POLICY[Policy + Approval Gate]
    ORCH --> EXEC[Action Executor]
    ORCH --> VERIFY[Verifier]
    ORCH --> AUDIT[Audit Recorder]

    OBS --> MCP[contribbot MCP]
    DECIDE --> MCP
    EXEC --> MCP
    MCP --> GH[GitHub API / gh CLI]
    MCP --> LOCAL[Todo / Upstream / Knowledge]

    DECIDE --> MODEL[Codex / Rules Backend]
    POLICY --> USER[Maintainer]
    EXEC -. approved code change .-> WT[Isolated Worktree]
    WT --> VERIFY
    VERIFY --> RUN
    RUN --> AUDIT
    AUDIT --> STORE[~/.contribbot/repo/patrol]

    AUDIT --> LEARN[Knowledge Evolver]
    LEARN --> PROPOSAL[Reviewable Knowledge Proposal]
    PROPOSAL --> USER
    USER -. approve .-> LOCAL
